{"id":8867095216327,"title":"Dragonfly Patchwork Quilt Set, Animal Patchwork Bedset - Dragonfly","handle":"dragonfly-patchwork-quilt-set-animal-patchwork-bedset-dragonfly","description":"\u003cp\u003eEmbrace rustic charm and cozy comfort with this beautiful Dragonfly Patchwork Quilt Set, perfect for adding a touch of warmth and tradition to any bedroom. This versatile quilt set also makes a thoughtful and customizable gift for loved ones.\u003c\/p\u003e\u003ch3\u003eKey Features\u003c\/h3\u003e\u003cul\u003e\n\u003cli\u003e\n\u003cstrong\u003eProduct Style:\u003c\/strong\u003e Features a delightful Dragonfly Patchwork style, bringing a touch of nature and farmhouse elegance to your home.\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003e\n\u003cstrong\u003eMeaningful Gift:\u003c\/strong\u003e An ideal present for Christmas, New Year, holidays, anniversaries, birthdays, or any special occasion, perfect for mom, dad, sister, brother, grandma, grandpa, wife, husband, son, daughter, and other beloved ones.\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003e\n\u003cstrong\u003ePersonalized Design:\u003c\/strong\u003e Customize your quilt set by selecting size options, adding pillowcases, or including a name for a truly unique touch.\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003e\n\u003cstrong\u003eAvailable Sizes:\u003c\/strong\u003e Offered in a range of sizes to suit your needs: Throw (60''x70''), Twin (68\"x86\"), Full (80\"x90\"), Queen (90\"x90\"), and King (102''x91'').\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003e\n\u003cstrong\u003eMaterial Details:\u003c\/strong\u003e Crafted from soft and durable microfiber polycotton fabric for comfortable use.\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003e\n\u003cstrong\u003eEasy Care:\u003c\/strong\u003e Machine washable for convenience; wash separately in cold water and air dry without heat for best results. Using a mesh laundry bag is recommended.\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003e\n\u003cstrong\u003eIncluded Components:\u003c\/strong\u003e Each set includes 1 quilt, with the option to add 2 pillowcases.\u0